<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>HlaleleDAO Deployment Ritual Board</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background:#2E1A47; color:#FDFEFE; }
    h2 { margin:20px; color:#F1C40F; }
    .column { background:#1C0F2E; border:1px solid #F1C40F; border-radius:6px; padding:10px; min-height:300px; }
    .task { background:#FDFEFE; color:#2E1A47; margin:5px; padding:8px; border-radius:4px; cursor:grab; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>🚀 Deployment Ritual Board</h2>
  <div class="column">
    <div class="task">Create branch (sandbox-deploy)</div>
    <div class="task">Push branch to GitHub</div>
    <div class="task">Vercel auto-deploy preview URL</div>
    <div class="task">Check build logs (no errors)</div>
    <div class="task">Confirm environment variables set correctly</div>
    <div class="task">Test API routes and endpoints</div>
    <div class="task">Verify CDN routing (Vercel + Cloudflare)</div>
    <div class="task">Log deployment timestamp and archive JSON</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>




